1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,240
So… your agent returned a <font color="#FF5252"><b>wrong answer</b></font>.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,520
But the status is <font color="#FF5252"><b>200</b></font>.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,120
The JSON is <font color="#FF5252"><b>valid</b></font>.

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:07,600
And the retry logic

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:08,840
<font color="#FF5252"><b>never triggered</b></font>.

6
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,900
Every retry you've written

7
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,980
assumes the failure <font color="#00FFFF"><b>announces itself</b></font>.

8
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,800
A <font color="#00FFFF"><b>hallucination</b></font> returns <font color="#4ADE80"><b>success</b></font>.

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,260
Right shape.

10
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,380
<font color="#FF5252"><b>Wrong content</b></font>.

11
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:18,360
<font color="#FF5252"><b>Nothing to catch</b></font>.

12
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:19,300
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Rule one.</b></font>

13
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,200
The failure <font color="#FFD700"><b>looks like a success</b></font>.

14
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,320
Building agents? Follow —

15
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,100
this is the layer.

16
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,100
Everywhere else,

17
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,500
spotting the failure was <font color="#4ADE80"><b>free</b></font>.

18
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,840
The <font color="#00FFFF"><b>exception</b></font> arrives on its own.

19
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:32,140
Here, only <font color="#00FFFF"><b>another model call</b></font> knows it's wrong.

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,150
<font color="#FF5252"><b>Cost of checking</b></font>

21
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,380
is equal to <font color="#FF5252"><b>cost of producing</b></font>.

22
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,600
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Rule two.</b></font> Detection has a <font color="#FFD700"><b>minimum cost</b></font>

23
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:38,580
<font color="#FFD700"><b>attached to it.</b></font>

24
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,140
Don't ask — <font color="#FF5252"><b>is this true?</b></font>

25
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,920
That's the <font color="#FF5252"><b>expensive</b></font> question.

26
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,000
Ask whether every id and number

27
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,820
<font color="#00FFFF"><b>came from the input</b></font>.

28
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,300
A <font color="#00FFFF"><b>string operation</b></font>.

29
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:49,920
It's <font color="#4ADE80"><b>free</b></font>.

30
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,720
And it catches <font color="#4ADE80"><b>invented objects</b></font>.

31
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,200
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Rule three.</b></font> <font color="#FFD700"><b>Ground for free.</b></font>

32
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,580
Buy truth only where it's <font color="#FFD700"><b>irreversible</b></font>.
